{"2363840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aikyam", "steam_appid": 2363840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village of Aikyam is plunged into chaos as demons erupt from darkness, while citizens begin to mysteriously vanish! It’s up to Vishva, Ramli, and Guruji to rally the disgruntled citizens with dazzling dance spectacles to fight against the demons in this over-the-top, Bollywood-inspired fantasy RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/a6a5140ea64b7094ebbcde6fb2531271.avif?t=1787072698\" width=615 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/643c70e0cec9bf5242cf18f19018405a.poster.avif?t=1787072698\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/643c70e0cec9bf5242cf18f19018405a.webm?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/643c70e0cec9bf5242cf18f19018405a.mp4?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore hope with electrifying performances, dramatic leaps and twirls, and gravity-defying stunts by dazzling your opponents in cinematic battles inspired by iconic Indian cinema.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master attacks by timing your moves perfectly to stick the landing, and parry incoming enemy strikes to reduce damage and turn the fight in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/16a9fecdded92bae2a3b3dc73e27f5cb.avif?t=1787072698\" width=615 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/732e7cc5dcac5dfdc030867397a661b3.poster.avif?t=1787072698\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/732e7cc5dcac5dfdc030867397a661b3.webm?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/732e7cc5dcac5dfdc030867397a661b3.mp4?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every act of compassion ripples through your village. Unlock new adventures and gain courageous cheerleaders for battles by aiding them in charming quests of kindness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By completing heartfelt quests, you will build a crowd to cheer you on during battles. The more lives you change, the stronger you become, unlocking powerful cinematic abilities and devastating combo attacks. Impress the crowd enough and they will leap into battle to fight at your side with surprise assists of their own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/d5b13739e2fc9ae6fa9b0b487d843d43.avif?t=1787072698\" width=615 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/2b69a036bc19018d975667e126a7dcd2.poster.avif?t=1787072698\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/2b69a036bc19018d975667e126a7dcd2.webm?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/2b69a036bc19018d975667e126a7dcd2.mp4?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrive in this fantastical larger-than-life world of Ancient India, where characters unite to conquer challenges twice their size!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast lands filled with hidden paths, secrets, and quests waiting to be discovered. Uncover the mysteries of Aikyam’s looming threat as you encounter acts-of-kindness challenges, hilarious (or dire) side quests, and incredible snippets of Indian epics hidden throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The village of Aikyam is plunged into chaos as demons erupt from darkness, while citizens begin to mysteriously vanish! It’s up to Vishva, Ramli, and Guruji to rally the disgruntled citizens with dazzling dance spectacles to fight against the demons in this over-the-top, Bollywood-inspired fantasy RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/a6a5140ea64b7094ebbcde6fb2531271.avif?t=1787072698\" width=615 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/643c70e0cec9bf5242cf18f19018405a.poster.avif?t=1787072698\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/643c70e0cec9bf5242cf18f19018405a.webm?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/643c70e0cec9bf5242cf18f19018405a.mp4?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore hope with electrifying performances, dramatic leaps and twirls, and gravity-defying stunts by dazzling your opponents in cinematic battles inspired by iconic Indian cinema.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master attacks by timing your moves perfectly to stick the landing, and parry incoming enemy strikes to reduce damage and turn the fight in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/16a9fecdded92bae2a3b3dc73e27f5cb.avif?t=1787072698\" width=615 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/732e7cc5dcac5dfdc030867397a661b3.poster.avif?t=1787072698\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/732e7cc5dcac5dfdc030867397a661b3.webm?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/732e7cc5dcac5dfdc030867397a661b3.mp4?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every act of compassion ripples through your village. Unlock new adventures and gain courageous cheerleaders for battles by aiding them in charming quests of kindness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By completing heartfelt quests, you will build a crowd to cheer you on during battles. The more lives you change, the stronger you become, unlocking powerful cinematic abilities and devastating combo attacks. Impress the crowd enough and they will leap into battle to fight at your side with surprise assists of their own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/d5b13739e2fc9ae6fa9b0b487d843d43.avif?t=1787072698\" width=615 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/2b69a036bc19018d975667e126a7dcd2.poster.avif?t=1787072698\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/2b69a036bc19018d975667e126a7dcd2.webm?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/extras/2b69a036bc19018d975667e126a7dcd2.mp4?t=1787072698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrive in this fantastical larger-than-life world of Ancient India, where characters unite to conquer challenges twice their size!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast lands filled with hidden paths, secrets, and quests waiting to be discovered. Uncover the mysteries of Aikyam’s looming threat as you encounter acts-of-kindness challenges, hilarious (or dire) side quests, and incredible snippets of Indian epics hidden throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dazzle the hearts of disgruntled villagers with extravagant turn-based battles and rally them against demons in this Bollywood-inspired fantasy RPG!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/header.jpg?t=1787072698", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/3c4acb4c59e76e88d457656d4ab3c77429f9047c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787072698", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2363840/3c4acb4c59e76e88d457656d4ab3c77429f9047c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787072698", "website": "https://aikyamgame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700H 2.40 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 2070</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_noti